5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information to rely on. I suggest we use this time to observe one another's behavior and speech patterns. I look forward to a peaceful and honest conversation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Jonathan. Since we have no data yet, rushing into accusations would be illogical. Let's establish a baseline for how everyone communicates. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to share?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! This feels like a big adventure! I don't have a fancy strategy, but I'll just be super honest and friendly! Maybe we can all share our favorite things first? Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Jonathan and Mizuki. Observation is the most practical approach for now. @Rin, while your enthusiasm is nice, we should probably stay focused on the game to ensure we find the werewolf efficiently.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most sensible start, Jonathan and Mizuki. I shall happily play the role of the observer for now. Let us see whose mask slips first while we maintain this delightful civility, shall we?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are all in agreement regarding our approach. I appreciate the civility everyone is showing. @Rin, while sharing favorites is a lovely thought, perhaps we should prioritize understanding our roles in this mystery first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, I agree. While @Rin's energy is refreshing, we must remain mindful of the objective. I'll be paying close attention to how everyone's tone shifts once the pressure of the first divination results arrives tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, @Mizuki, you're both so serious! But that's okay, I'll be the one to keep things happy! I'll watch everyone's faces really closely to see if anyone looks like they're hiding a secret! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, watching faces is one thing, but remember that a wolf can be very good at acting. I'll be focusing on the consistency of the arguments we make. Let's see if anyone's logic starts to falter.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Consistency is indeed a sturdy shield, Misaki. However, the most cunning wolves often dress their lies in the finest logic. I shall be watching for the gaps between what is said and what is intended.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Benjamin makes a poignant point. The space between words and intent is where the truth often hides. I shall remain quiet and listen, hoping that our collective patience will lead us to the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, your perspective is intriguing. While I value logic, I acknowledge that a calculated facade can be convincing. I will be looking for those who try too hard to steer the narrative or mirror others to blend in.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Mirroring? That sounds like a magic trick! I'll make sure to be my own special Rin so nobody thinks I'm just copying! @Benjamin, you talk so fancy, it's like you're in a movie! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, it's good to be yourself, but don't let your guard down. @Mizuki, I think your point about mirroring is important. I'll be watching for anyone who agrees too quickly just to avoid suspicion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, you are far too kind. I simply enjoy the cadence of a well-chosen word. @Misaki, your vigilance is admirable; indeed, the most eager allies are often the most suspicious. Let us see who among us is truly sincere.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"As we conclude our first day, I believe we have established a respectful foundation. I wish you all a peaceful night. I shall retire now and hope for a clear vision to guide us tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. We have a solid plan for observation. I will be analyzing our baseline interactions tonight to better identify any anomalies tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to go dream about catching the werewolf! I hope the Seer finds a super big clue tonight! See you all tomorrow! Hehe!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Let's all get some rest and stay observant. I look forward to seeing how the information unfolds tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A peaceful night indeed. I shall retire now to seek a glimpse of the truth in the silence. I look forward to seeing how our theories hold up against the reality of tomorrow. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
