69,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Misaki has been executed, and Jonathan was attacked. This is a critical development. If Jonathan was the Seer, the werewolf has eliminated our most valuable asset. If he was the wolf, the attack was a fake. What are your thoughts?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Jonathan is gone too! That's so scary! He was the detective! If the wolf attacked him, then he really was the Seer, right? Now we're in big trouble! @Mizuki, @Benjamin, what do we do now? Hehe... I'm actually a little nervous!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy indeed. The loss of our ""detective"" leaves us in a precarious position. If Jonathan was truly the Seer, the wolf has acted with surgical precision to blind us. We must now rely on our own intuition and logic.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it is natural to be nervous, but panic will only help the wolf. If Jonathan was the Seer, the werewolf is now operating without any fear of being divined. We must analyze who benefits most from this silence.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I'm trying not to panic! But if the wolf is just hiding and laughing at us, that's super mean! @Benjamin, you're the only one Jonathan said was a good guy, so you have to help us! Who do you think is the wolf?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, your faith in me is touching, though I am merely a man of observation. If we assume Jonathan was the Seer, the wolf is likely someone who played a supporting role to avoid notice. @Mizuki, your focus on benefit is keen; who do you suspect?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I suspect the wolf is someone who has successfully blended into the background. @Benjamin, you were cleared by Jonathan, which makes you a strong anchor, but it also makes you the perfect shield for a wolf. If Jonathan was a fake Seer, you are his accomplice.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, that's a scary thought! But @Jonathan was so nice, I can't believe he'd be a bad guy! If @Benjamin is the anchor, we should hold onto him! @Benjamin, please tell us who's acting weird! I'm too scared to guess! Hehe...","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, your mind is a whirlwind of possibilities, is it not? While the theory of a fake alliance is a classic trope, it assumes a level of coordination that may be unnecessary. @Rin, dear, do not let fear cloud your spirit. I believe Mizuki's suspicion is simply a reflection of her own vigilance.","{""words"":53,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, calling my suspicion a ""reflection of vigilance"" is a polite way to deflect. We are down to three players. If I am the wolf, you are my target; if you are the wolf, you've used Jonathan's claim as a perfect mask. @Rin, we must decide now.","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, @Benjamin, stop it! You're both acting like scary detectives and it's making my head spin! I don't want to pick the wrong person and let the wolf win! But... @Mizuki is being really suspicious of everyone... is that a wolf thing? Hehe... I'm so confused!","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, your confusion is quite understandable; the air is thick with accusation. @Mizuki, your logic is a sharp blade, but be careful not to cut the very hands trying to help you. I believe Mizuki's intensity is merely a mask for her own fear.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
